From a86d57be3b0ec08523260b7152b13c0ed7f370ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 05:17:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST War: SiegeArmy fix: no optional-slot build
 requests on the operation's first turn

addAIOperation aborts a new operation that needs more units built than it was
allowed (NoUnits). Asking for the optional slots at creation killed every
waiting city attack the turn it was made (logged siege pair 043923C9: a new
operation ID every turn, each ending NoUnits with Duration 0).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZizcmgfGkXsgJcVcF7h
---
 CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvAIOperation.cpp | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvAIOperation.cpp b/CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvAIOperation.cpp
index 5b3d5b6c8..500411bc4 100644
--- a/CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvAIOperation.cpp
+++ b/CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvAIOperation.cpp
@@ -550,8 +550,9 @@ int CvAIOperation::GrabUnitsFromTheReserves(CvPlot* pMusterPlot, CvPlot* pTarget
 
 	std::stable_sort(choices.begin(),choices.end());
 
-	//AI_AB_TEST (candidate, flag SiegeArmy)
-	const bool bAskForOptionalSlots = IsArmyTooWeakForTarget(pArmy);
+	//AI_AB_TEST (candidate, flag SiegeArmy). Not on the turn the operation is created: CvPlayer::addAIOperation aborts a
+	//new operation that needs more units built than it was allowed (NoUnits), which killed every waiting attack at once
+	const bool bAskForOptionalSlots = GC.getGame().getGameTurn() > GetTurnStarted() && IsArmyTooWeakForTarget(pArmy);
 
 	//rebuild the list
 	int iCount = 0;
-- 
2.43.0

